**Mobile App Testing Plan**

Project: To-do-list Mobile App

Testing Scope:
- Authentication testing
- Task management workflows
- Navigation & UI validation
- Notifications testing
- Negative scenario

Approach:
Manual functional, usability, and exploratory testing across Android device environments.

Entry Criteria:
- App installed
- Test data prepared

Exit Criteria:
- All test cases executed
- Critical defects resolved
Risks & Mitigations:
- Network instability → Test offline & retry flows
- Device fragmentation → Test across screen sizes
